Z||000000||Kage86GT4SP||08-07-99||03:55 AM||||I'm looking for a 5sp to swap in....<p>I guess it would be helpful if I could get a list of the various makes and models that I could possibly get one of these 5 sppeds from.<p>The Izuzu is being discussed in another thread, but which models of the I have the trans that would work?  I also hear the trans from a Citation would work...  anyone know what the others are? <p>Thanx!<p>K
Z||000001||PaUL||08-09-99||12:53 AM||||As far as I know the only 2 5spd trans that have the right bolt pattern are the Isuzu and Getrag. The Isuzu was used in lots of FWD GM cars with 4 cyclinder engines. The getrag only became available after 87 and was used on FWD cars with V6s. Before 87 GM only used a 4 spd trans with the v6s. <p>Seems like only the smaller GM cars came with a manual transmission. The J cars would be your likely source for a trans swap.
